DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The uucchhccoomm driver supports WinChipHead CH9102/343/341/340 serial devices.

     The CH341/340 devices only support a variety of baud rates up to 921600.
     CH9102/343 devices support any baud rate up to 6 Mbps.

